From: Ryan Murray <81541646+RyanTheTide@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] thunkgen: LLVM 23 has no FileManager stat cache

LLVM 23 removed clang::FileManager::clearStatCache() together with the
stat cache it cleared, so there is nothing left to clear. Keep the call
for older LLVM releases.

Signed-off-by: Ryan Murray <81541646+RyanTheTide@users.noreply.github.com>
Assisted-by: LLM
---
 ThunkLibs/Generator/gen.cpp | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/ThunkLibs/Generator/gen.cpp
+++ b/ThunkLibs/Generator/gen.cpp
@@ -840,6 +840,8 @@
 
   const bool Success = Compiler.ExecuteAction(Action);
 
+#if LLVM_VERSION_MAJOR < 23
   Files->clearStatCache();
+#endif
   return Success;
 }
